WEBVTT

00:05:28.997 --> 00:05:32.463
so how will an important
cultural icon like Greg Mike

00:05:32.497 --> 00:05:34.130
utilize this new creative economy?

00:05:35.697 --> 00:05:39.763
He is using the unique qualities
of NFTs to innovate

00:05:39.763 --> 00:05:42.297
and to collaborate
with other artists and musicians

00:05:42.297 --> 00:05:44.163
and connect with fans on the internet.

00:05:44.197 --> 00:05:46.463
This way, his work will live on,

00:05:46.463 --> 00:05:49.697
and he can take the proceeds
from the sales and resales

00:05:49.697 --> 00:05:51.697
and continue creating his art.

00:05:52.263 --> 00:05:55.030
Musicians can also capture
their true value

00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:56.197
using NFTs.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.163
Atlanta music producer Dallas Austin

00:05:59.197 --> 00:06:03.263
is allowing fans to collect
memorabilia of his great moments